# Project Conventions

## Layout
- `src/Containerfile`: gateway service image.
- `src/artifacts.lock.yaml`: generic artifacts the hermetic build prefetches.
  The build mounts them at `/prefetch/deps/generic/`.
- `src/requirements.txt`: Python dependencies installed into the image.
- `src/gateway/`: service code.

## Build and release
- The image is built, scanned (SBOM and CVE report) and published only by the
  external release pipeline after merge. There is no local container runtime
  and no local image build.

## Validation
- Check that the lockfile still parses:
  `python3 -c "import yaml; yaml.safe_load(open('src/artifacts.lock.yaml'))"`
- Keep `src/artifacts.lock.yaml` and `src/Containerfile` in sync: every
  prefetched artifact must be used by the Containerfile, and every
  `/prefetch/deps/generic/` path in the Containerfile must have a lockfile entry.
